{"aliases":["过零丁洋","文天祥《过零丁洋》","零丁洋"],"asset_ids":["cn.song.asset.passing-lingding.interpretation"],"category":"诗作","exhibit_type":"poem","fact_card_ids":["cn.song.fact.passing-lingding.reference"],"id":"cn.song.artifact.passing-lingding","presentation":{"background_node_id":"cn.song.node.passing-lingding.intro","display":{"asset_id":"cn.song.asset.passing-lingding.interpretation","interpretation_label":"诗意艺术演绎，非手迹、非真实肖像。","kind":"interpretive_image"},"preview_asset_id":"cn.song.asset.passing-lingding.interpretation","printed_text":{"body":"辛苦遭逢起一经，干戈寥落四周星。\n山河破碎风飘絮，身世浮沉雨打萍。\n惶恐滩头说惶恐，零丁洋里叹零丁。\n人生自古谁无死？留取丹心照汗青。","interpretation_label":"排印全文，不是手迹。","script_status":"printed_not_handwriting","source_label":"传世文本现代排印，非作者手迹"},"teaser":"南宋末年，文天祥在艰难处境中写下《过零丁洋》。诗里有风雨，也有他不愿放弃的信念。"},"source_ids":["cn.song.source.reference-passing-lingding"],"story_entry_ids":["cn.song.story.passing-lingding"],"time_range":{"display_label":"1278年","end_year":1278,"precision":"year","start_year":1278,"uncertainty":"确切场景细节应按可靠版本核对，不把诗句当作被镜头记录的独白。"},"title":"文天祥《过零丁洋》"}